name: sim.getPluginName
description: Retrieves a plugin name based on an index
luaSynopsis: string pluginName = sim.getPluginName(int index)
pythonSynopsis: string pluginName = sim.getPluginName(int index)
inputs:
1. index: index to a plugin. To list-up all plugin names, start with index=0 and increment index until return value is None/nil
outputs:
1. pluginName: name of the plugin or None/nil if no plugin is available at that index position.
